# Large binary model files — never commit these; regenerate from training scripts
*.joblib

# Blanket JSON ignore — the negation lines below override it for specific files
*.json

# Provenance files needed for auditability — these MUST be committed.
# Anyone reviewing the repo can verify the model was produced by the documented
# training pipeline by checking dataset_hash + confidence_threshold in metadata.json.
!metadata.json
!symbol_baselines.json
